{"number":586,"title":"A Solvable Model of Adaptive Learning Rate Rescaling: Acceleration, Stability & Scaling","labels":["Dynamics","GNS","LLM","LRSchedule","Optimization"],"state":"open","created_at":"2026-10-06T21:37:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T21:37:32Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiroki11x/Papers/issues/586","body":"## Links\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2610.06701\n\n## TLDR\nNormalized SGDを理論の対象としてる\n\n勾配正規化（norm-SGD）は勾配の減衰に応じて実効学習率を自動的に引き上げ、学習初期の収束速度を大幅に加速させます\n。 しかし、実効学習率の上昇は最終的に安定性限界（Edge of Stability等）に達して加速が崩壊するため、本論文はモデル幅やバッチサイズに対する計算効率の最適条件を理論的に解明\n\n<img width=\"884\" height=\"473\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11a86497-d7dd-47cc-abfb-afaf1e6a4742\" />\n\n<img width=\"878\" height=\"463\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b15fe778-5137-4fb2-98b7-331b798fe19c\" />\n\n<img width=\"878\" height=\"470\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e83e6585-6ab6-4219-a4ee-dacdda3922d0\" />\n\n<img width=\"877\" height=\"475\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e0fbf40-2752-4529-900e-63b5ad4b7856\" />\n\n\nCBSで、EoSS と EoS が切り替わる\n\n<img width=\"1287\" height=\"623\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03eea82c-a62f-46d3-9bb8-65360fa77679\" />"}
